<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0356_R16R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cycling Road start here.\rIt’s ALL downhill, so it’s a RUSH. No\nbrakes. Literally. They stole ’em.\rSome people like the Fast Ship and\nMagnet Train. You a Bike person, ain’t\fyou?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0356_R16R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO! STOP right there!\rYou gotta be on a Bike to go on\nCycling Road! No walkers! No\fskateboards! No\fheelys!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
